---
// Contact section component with practice info and CTA
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div>
        <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
        <p>Ready to schedule your appointment or have questions about our services? We'd love to hear from you!</p>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <strong>Phone:</strong> (512) 555-0123
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <strong>Email:</strong> info@1460dental.com
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <strong>Address:</strong> 1460 Main Street, Georgetown, TX 78628
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <strong>Hours:</strong> Monday-Friday 8:00 AM - 6:00 PM
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book Appointment</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3>Emergency Care</h3>
        <p>Experiencing a dental emergency? Don't wait - call us immediately for urgent care.</p>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <strong>Emergency Line:</strong> (512) 555-0911
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <strong>After Hours:</strong> Available 24/7 for emergencies
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3 style="margin-top: 32px;">New Patients</h3>
        <p>New to our practice? We're accepting new patients and offer special pricing for first-time visitors.</p>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <a href="/new-patients" class="btn">New Patient Info</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section> 